      "endsWhen": "Invisibility Burst ends early with movement or combat; Jungle Terrain Boost expires when leaving a jungle environment.",
      "charges": "Unlimited uses"
    },
    "aiReviewedAt": "2026-07-22T01:35:27.801937+00:00"
  },
